{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the core dragon flight mechanics, including aerial combat against other dragons and fire-based assaults on enemy camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It represents a later mission from the full game and offers a glimpse into the world and combat systems. Not all features are present, and some mechanics will be expanded in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save progress will not carry over.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This is just a tempting taste of something much greater.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0005_text.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dragon flight that feels alive, with responsive movement and real combat control. It is not only a Dragon fight.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the ground, battles are built on precision and timing, combining melee weapons, spellcasting, and steampunk firearms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can handle combat by using their dragon for aerial attacks or dismounting to fight on the ground with weapons, spells, and firearms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-rich RPG with original lore where your choices and actions shape the world and its outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0004_Dragon-Battle.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/DragonVsDragon-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manual dragon flight with full control over climb, dive, hovering, and sharp turns with fire breath, enabling close-range attacks like claw swipes, bites, and tackles during real-time aerial combat against other dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/Title4.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/CampAttack1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the brutal force of fire on enemy bases or drag soldiers into the sky and show them the terrifying weight of gravity, all while evading the deadly reach of base defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0003_Dragon-vs-Airships.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/ShipAttack2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack flying ships by targeting sails, engines, and cannons with fire breath, while evading heavy cannon fire that poses a serious threat to your dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0001_Close-Quarters-Combat.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/Melee1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the ground, battles are built on precision and timing, combining swords, axes, and spears with spellcasting and steampunk firearms for skill-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/Title6.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sagas of Lumin offers a deep story where your choices change the outcome. The world is morally complex and avoids clich\u00e9 good-versus-evil narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hangar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717300/d18e17bf8ce1983f326e01a6f4ddcb86fccc2294.jpg"},{"name":"Forest Wiser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3717300/d024cce396ae7c2607a36c0843b021559f8aa6fa.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717300?t=1747947641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717300?t=1747947641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/8ba5bd18b9137c987714bac602305ea436777ab2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747947641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/8ba5bd18b9137c987714bac602305ea436777ab2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747947641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Sagas of Lumin features intense battles and warfare. Combat includes the use of swords, axes, and other melee weapons, as well as firearms. Blood is visible during these encounters, but no dismemberment occurs. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the core dragon flight mechanics, including aerial combat against other dragons and fire-based assaults on enemy camps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It represents a later mission from the full game and offers a glimpse into the world and combat systems. Not all features are present, and some mechanics will be expanded in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save progress will not carry over.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This is just a tempting taste of something much greater.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0005_text.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dragon flight that feels alive, with responsive movement and real combat control. It is not only a Dragon fight.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the ground, battles are built on precision and timing, combining melee weapons, spellcasting, and steampunk firearms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can handle combat by using their dragon for aerial attacks or dismounting to fight on the ground with weapons, spells, and firearms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-rich RPG with original lore where your choices and actions shape the world and its outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0004_Dragon-Battle.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/DragonVsDragon-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manual dragon flight with full control over climb, dive, hovering, and sharp turns with fire breath, enabling close-range attacks like claw swipes, bites, and tackles during real-time aerial combat against other dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/Title4.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/CampAttack1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the brutal force of fire on enemy bases or drag soldiers into the sky and show them the terrifying weight of gravity, all while evading the deadly reach of base defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0003_Dragon-vs-Airships.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/ShipAttack2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack flying ships by targeting sails, engines, and cannons with fire breath, while evading heavy cannon fire that poses a serious threat to your dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/_0001_Close-Quarters-Combat.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/Melee1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the ground, battles are built on precision and timing, combining swords, axes, and spears with spellcasting and steampunk firearms for skill-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/extras/Title6.png?t=1747947641\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sagas of Lumin offers a deep story where your choices change the outcome. The world is morally complex and avoids clich\u00e9 good-versus-evil narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Elos Games & Arts"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3130220","name":"Sagas of Lumin"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/3f517eff33cab54d5b83386223b39a0ce6fcc117/header.jpg?t=1747947641","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Elos Games Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137371,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137371/movie480.mp4?t=1747849120","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137371/movie_max.mp4?t=1747849120"},"name":"Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137371/8d1bcfb27cd4eeb6e9bbdf3c01f2cc921ba3ccb2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747849120","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137371/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747849120","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137371/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747849120"}}],"name":"Sagas of Lumin Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</