3f16a5d7523f8c432eda5faf1.600x338.jpg?t=1747947641"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/5e3ec72f02370384682911745187f473a2190a40/ss_5e3ec72f02370384682911745187f473a2190a40.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747947641","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/5e3ec72f02370384682911745187f473a2190a40/ss_5e3ec72f02370384682911745187f473a2190a40.600x338.jpg?t=1747947641"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/d6b87d010ba57d28bcd84f347e16bb85c300316a/ss_d6b87d010ba57d28bcd84f347e16bb85c300316a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747947641","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/d6b87d010ba57d28bcd84f347e16bb85c300316a/ss_d6b87d010ba57d28bcd84f347e16bb85c300316a.600x338.jpg?t=1747947641"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/40da09d958c3fc93f0e6eef00aae3491cfbb2ca8/ss_40da09d958c3fc93f0e6eef00aae3491cfbb2ca8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747947641","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717300/40da09d958c3fc93f0e6eef00aae3491cfbb2ca8/ss_40da09d958c3fc93f0e6eef00aae3491cfbb2ca8.600x338.jpg?t=1747947641"}],"short_description":"Sagas of Lumin is a single-player action RPG featuring dragon flight that feels alive with full movement and combat control. Switch between aerial battles and ground combat using melee weapons, spells, and firearms. Your choices shape a deep, branching world.","steam_appid":3717300,"support_info":{"email":"info@elosgames.net","url":"www.elosgames.net"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":"https://www.elosgames.net"}